mage link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Mattis\" title=\"Mattis\">Mattis</a> at his shop in <a href=\"/wiki/Last_Light_Inn\" title=\"Last Light Inn\">Last Light Inn</a>\n</p>\n</div>   <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>As per the description, cannot actually prevent being Surprised.\n</p>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714200226\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.051 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.053 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1541/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 24105/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 5419/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 1/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.011/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 930885/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   43.010      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   43.010      1 -total\n 48.46%   20.843      6 Template:Icon_text\n 43.15%   18.557     16 Template:Trim\n 22.16%    9.532      2 Template:Uid\n 16.82%    7.236      1 Template:Main_only\n 13.88%    5.968      2 Template:Icon_link\n 13.52%    5.813      1 Template:PageSeo\n 13.38%    5.754      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 13.02%    5.598      2 Template:Template_style\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:22253-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714200226 and revision id 294881. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}